# Kamal secrets — SAFE FOR GIT: references only, never raw values.
#
# Each `NAME=$NAME` pulls NAME from the environment Kamal was started with. `make
# deploy` include+export's the gitignored `.env`, so these resolve from there; a raw
# `kamal …` invocation needs `set -a; source .env; set +a` first, or they resolve
# empty and the container boots with no credential.
#
# Every name here must also appear under `env.secret` (or be referenced by
# `registry.password`) in config/deploy.yml.
API_KEY=$API_KEY
KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD=$KAMAL_REGISTRY_PASSWORD
